# Animiru reference folder
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Animiru source code (cloned into ./animiru-src/) is a
# read-only reference snapshot, gitignored so it stays local and
# is never committed. Only the DOCUMENTATION/ folder (our analysis
# notes) is committed — following the same convention as the
# sibling ANIYOMI_REFRENCE/ and OLD_ANIKUTA/ folders.
#
# See ../README.md for the _REFERENCES/ rules (READ-ONLY, no builds).

# Ignore everything in this folder
*

# But allow the DOCUMENTATION folder and its contents
!DOCUMENTATION/
!DOCUMENTATION/**

# Allow this .gitignore itself
!.gitignore
